      section: "CS",
      q: "Which one or more of the following need to be saved on a context switch from one thread (T1) of a process to another thread (T2) of the same process?",
      options: ["Page table base register","Stack pointer","Program counter","General purpose registers"],
      answers: [1,2,3],
